---
// CuriositySection.astro - Curiosity as the compass, pure Google Sans typography
---

<section id="curiosity" class="curiosity-room">
  <div class="curiosity-inner">
    <div class="section-label">Philosophy</div>

    <blockquote class="curiosity-statement">
      Curiosity is the clue to derive solutions to a problem and we are extremely curious.
    </blockquote>

    <div class="curiosity-prose">
      <p>
        When facing complex, systemic challenges, assumptions only lead to dead ends. We believe the deepest answers cannot be forced with brute strength or borrowed templates.
      </p>
      <p>
        They reveal themselves when you look with unhurried wonder. By asking the quiet, persistent questions others overlook, we dismantle layers of noise until the simplest, most sustainable architecture emerges.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Clean, understated principles layout - pure text, no cards -->
    <div class="principles-flow">
      <div class="principle-item">
        <span class="item-num">01</span>
        <h3 class="item-title">Inquiry over Assumptions</h3>
        <p class="item-desc">
          We strip problems back to first principles before designing a single line of code or system architecture.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="principle-item">
        <span class="item-num">02</span>
        <h3 class="item-title">Sustainable by Nature</h3>
        <p class="item-desc">
          Solutions that endure. Engineered to minimize computational waste and designed for longevity, not quick fixes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="principle-item">
        <span class="item-num">03</span>
        <h3 class="item-title">Scalable for Impact</h3>
        <p class="item-desc">
          Architectures built with frictionless expansion so that quiet insights can scale to meet planetary needs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .curiosity-room {
    padding: 10rem 3rem;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
  }

  .curiosity-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .curiosity-statement {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    max-width: 1050px;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .curiosity-prose {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    max-width: 980px;
  }

  .curiosity-prose p {
    font-family: var(--font-text);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .principles-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 3.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .principle-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .item-num {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-ink-subtle);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .item-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .item-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-text);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .curiosity-room {
      padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .curiosity-prose {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .principles-flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
